The goal is to have schools upload their student robot video clips and share the code on codemyrobotchallenge.com

The schools with the most individual student uploads will have their choice of

**A 3D printer for their makerspace area**

**Class set of CARL 6.1 robots**

**Starting in Dec the top 5 schools with the most uploads of code and video clips will receive more sensors and robots** 

**Access to our CARL 7 bootcamp  (summer 2019) – where CARL .7 will be equipped with WiFi,  for remote coding and control**

**We will add more as sponsor offer acceptable educational rewards and fun stuff**
